        <Description>The first generation of the Volsung Utility Fleet. The VI-UX is a sleek, light atmospheric-hydrogen hybrid designed for rapid, high-precision assembly and deconstruction. Tailored specifically for quick-strike welding or grinding projects, this highly maneuverable grid ensures complete operational autonomy in dark trenches and dense structural skeletons.</Description>
